      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wooster%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Strong education and advanced manufacturing have spawned firms like Quasar Energy Group, ExpenseWire, ABS Materials, 3i-ingredients, and Cureo.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
